#: ../../../variable/CTEST_CMAKE_GENERATOR.rst:2
msgid "CTEST_CMAKE_GENERATOR"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CTEST_CMAKE_GENERATOR.rst:4
msgid ""
"Specify the CTest ``CMakeGenerator`` setting in "
"a :manual:`ctest(1)` :ref:`Dashboard Client` script, or on "
"the :program:`ctest` command line via the :ctest-dashboard-option:`-D` "
"option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CTEST_CMAKE_GENERATOR.rst:8
msgid ""
"The :command:`ctest_configure` command passes this generator "
"to :manual:`cmake(1)` when :variable:`CTEST_CONFIGURE_COMMAND` is not set. "
"The :command:`ctest_build` command also uses it to compute the build command "
"line when :variable:`CTEST_BUILD_COMMAND` is not set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CTEST_CMAKE_GENERATOR.rst:13
msgid ""
"See also :variable:`CTEST_CMAKE_GENERATOR_PLATFORM` "
"and :variable:`CTEST_CMAKE_GENERATOR_TOOLSET`."
msgstr ""
